Vnum            6
Name            kerry~
ShortDesc       狼狗凱莉~
LongDesc        一隻看似凶狠的狼狗(Kerry)搖著尾巴。
~
Description
這隻是 Robin 家裡養的具有血統證明書的狼狗。
~
Sentinel        Yes
Effect          'sanctuary'
Effect          'infravision'
Effect          'protection'
Effect          'detect invis'
Effect          'detect hidden'
Alignment       100
Level           99
Hitroll         0
Protect         -1
Damroll         0
Str             100
Int             100
Wis             100
Dex             100
Con             100
Hp              100000
Mana            100000
Move            100000
Class           CLASS_BRAVO
Gold            0
Multipile       100
Migrate         0
Tractable       50
Sex             SEX_FEMALE
Enable          100 'dragon fist'
Enable          100 'ice freeze strike'
Enable          100 'linpo steps'

Process
Type            rand_prog
Chance          5
Text
emote 對著你狂叫。
~
End

Process
Type            fight_prog
Chance          80
Text
say $1主人不在家﹐你們就來欺負我…$0
 say $1看我必殺的一擊…$0
 mpadd $n HIT -20000
 mpadd $n MANA -1000
 mpadd $n MOVE -1000
 mpadd $n DOSAGE 100
 mpechoat $n $1$N$1覺得自己的精力瞬間急速下降。$0
 mpechoaround $n $1$N的精力急速流失。$0
~
End

Process
Type            fight_prog
Chance          80
Text
if rand(50)
   cast 'dragon fist'
   cast 'dragon fist'
   break
 endif
 cast 'ice freeze strike'
 cast 'ice freeze strike'
 cast 'ice freeze strike'
 cast 'poison'
~
End

End
